        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `moderate_text.py` that scores user text for unsafe or policy-violating content using a concrete external provider, I will use the Perspective API by Jigsaw. This API is designed to detect toxic and harmful content. I will import the necessary libraries, set up the API client, and define a function to send text to the API for moderation. </thinking>\n",
